message: "If you use the Nuro-SLAM integration platform, please cite this repository and the relevant original algorithm publications."
type: software
title: "Nuro-SLAM: Neuromorphic SLAM Research Platform"
authors:
# Project creator and maintainer: Pramod
  - name: Pramod
    affiliation: Indian Institute of Technology Mandi
abstract: >-
  Nuro-SLAM is an experimental research platform integrating
  event-based SLAM implementations and supporting research
  on neuromorphic computing, reproducible benchmarking,
  and collaborative multi-robot mapping.
keywords:
  - neuromorphic SLAM
  - event-based vision
  - simultaneous localization and mapping
  - multi-robot systems
  - robotics
  - research software
identifiers: []
